  "description": "A zoning robot: a front roller at Toggle height (port 8) that spins a Toggle either way, an optical sensor (port 9) that sees the Toggle face in front of the roller, and a rear fold-out plate (ADI B) that presses a Toggle one face per push. No game-piece manipulators.",
